index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..8b5c68f57978efa9ff358747713df50102b8a4d2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/bench/session_transport/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@
+# Persistent SDK transport experiment
+
+This checkout adds the persistent transport to product commit `5eae2cff`, so
+stateless and persistent trials share the 0.26 loop, request accounting,
+verification receipts, and quota waits. The product provider factory does not
+select this implementation. The benchmark explicitly overrides that factory.
+
+The product's later local-time wait UI and scoped generation-limit repair are
+also present. Product files match that commit; experimental modules and this
+smoke are the only additional source.
+
+Use `ExperimentalSessionSdkProvider(session_enabled=True)` for the treatment
+and the same class with `session_enabled=False` for its control. Both use the
+plain response protocol by default. SDK-native structured formatting remains
+an explicit, separate option.
+
+The session reuses only a strict append to the caller's selected history.
+Compaction, context elision, changed tools/system/model/effort, or an unknown
+assistant turn starts a new session. Images and simultaneous requests use the
+production stateless path. A provider or formatting error poisons its session.
+Unresolved process cleanup prevents starting another worker until extinction
+is confirmed.
+
+The earlier public code-review dialogue showed cache reuse, but it executed no
+host tools and does not establish a coding improvement. Unit tests and
+zero-model connection checks also do not prove a real multi-turn task works.
+The second subscription window must validate the actual worker, then compare
+fresh coding tasks against the stateless control. Preserve unsuccessful and
+budget-limited attempts in the results.
+
+For the bounded process smoke:
+
+```powershell
+python bench/session_transport/smoke_session_transport.py --out <new-directory> --turns 3 --model claude-opus-5 --effort high --i-will-spend
+```
+
+This smoke sends fixed observations and executes no host tools. Its outcome is
+transport evidence only. Coding comparisons use the frozen SWE evaluator and
+the independent grader; cleanup receipts are recorded separately from patch
+correctness.
